Subject: Welcome to Klai, you're in
<p>Hi {{ name }},</p>
<p>You made it. You're one of the first 100 companies to join Klai, and that means more to us than we can put into words.</p>
<p>We started Klai because we believe AI belongs to all of us. Not to a handful of platforms. Not to whoever has the biggest servers or the deepest pockets. To us. To the organisations doing real work with real data, and who deserve the tools to do it safely, privately, and on their own terms.</p>
<p>By joining our waitlist, you've told us something important: that you share that belief.</p>
<p>We're opening access to our private beta carefully and intentionally, because we want to get this right with you, not just for you. One of us will reach out to you personally to walk you through onboarding and make sure you're set up for success from day one.</p>
<p>Thank you for believing in something different.</p>
<p>Talk soon,<br>Jantine, Mark &amp; Steven<br>Founders of Klai</p>
<p style="font-size:14px;color:#666;margin-top:32px;">Pick a time yourself if you prefer:</p>
